msgstr "The icons are drawn on a 24 grid at stroke 2, and shown at stroke 1.6, scaled up a little until they fill their box. The gaps between their fine details stay open, and they sit level with your interface icons at the same size. They stay clear from 20 pixels up, and they look their best from 28 pixels, in cards and headings."

#: src/routes/Guide.svelte
