msgstr "Some icons have solid parts, such as the star in <0>Star and crescent</0> or the <1>filled</1> variants of the user icons. Those parts are filled with <2/> too, so they follow the same colour you choose for the stroke. If you choose a colour before copying or downloading, they take it with them."

